<view class="container">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">商砖小站 · 应用说明</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">浙江工商大学校园小程序。五个底部标签 + 五个小工具，两分钟看完。</view>
    <view class="hero-date">最后更新 {{updated}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="sec-title">五个底部标签</view>
    <view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="title" class="block">
      <view class="tab-head">
        <text class="tab-icon">{{item.icon}}</text>
        <text class="tab-name">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="tab-sub">{{item.sub}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:for="{{item.lines}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="*this" class="sec-line">· {{line}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="sec-note">{{item.note}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="sec-title">五个小工具（入口分散，写清楚从哪进）</view>
    <view wx:for="{{tools}}" wx:key="name" class="tool-row">
      <view class="tool-icon">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="tool-body">
        <view class="tool-name">
          {{item.name}}
          <text class="tool-from">{{item.from}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="tool-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="sec-title">几点设计上的讲究</view>
    <view wx:for="{{designs}}" wx:key="*this" class="sec-line">· {{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card warn-card">
    <view class="sec-title">用之前先看两句</view>
    <view wx:for="{{notes}}" wx:key="*this" class="sec-line warn-line">· {{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="sec-title">有想法怎么办</view>
    <view class="sec-line">· 缺功能、有意见：去论坛发一帖，管理员看得见。</view>
    <view class="sec-line">· 看到违规内容：在帖子里点举报，会自动进审核队列。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-primary tap" bindtap="onGoForum">去逛逛论坛</view>
</view>
